    "title": "Pulse: clocks on work cases only, overdue in the bell, an open trip still escalates",
    "why": "Jason, 2026-11-19: \"a clock makes sense on work a person owes an answer to\"; \"go that way, bell alerts and row marks\"; on an unresolved Control Board trip, \"YES\" it still escalates; security: \"Yes, clock security\". 0105's clocks now run only on Support, Sales, Fulfillment, Payments, Safety and Security (Pulse::CLOCKED); System and Team items carry none. An open trip shows no clock but goes to the Manager after its level's hours and to the Director after twice that. The bell lists what's critical, overdue, or escalated to you. Notes: 0105, 0171 §8. app/lib/Pulse.php, app/ui/pulse-ui.php; FAQ. Also restores #188's FAQ lines (the stream's order), overwritten by #189.",
